the world for a decade. An organization that creates projects, but not only creates them, we at BEST also implement them, and that is why we have become recognizable. BEST actively cooperates with companies from Croatia, the University of Zagreb and other renowned institutions, and in this way constantly builds the reputation of a serious and consistent student organization.<\/p><p>However, we also dare to say that BEST is not just an organization. BEST is a process. Indeed, it is a step between studying and future work. During this step, BEST offers you learning responsibility, learning teamwork, getting to know European environments, gaining invaluable experience, having fun, traveling and many other things. So don&#8217;t miss this opportunity that is being offered to you, come, join BEST and make your student days unforgettable.<\/p><\/div><div class=\"fusion-separator fusion-full-width-sep sep-none\">\u00a0<\/div><div class=\"fusion-button-wrapper fusion-aligncenter\"><a class=\"fusion-button button-flat fusion-button-default-size button-default button-1 fusion-button-span-no fusion-button-default-type\" href=\"https:\/\/forms.gle\/G219WJESgGQkSZBTA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><i class=\"fa-user-plus fas button-icon-left\"><\/i><span class=\"fusion-button-text\">Pridru\u017ei nam se<\/span><\/a><\/div><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Why join BEST? BEST gives you the chance to suggest, to present ideas, to criticize, to change, to correct, to participate in projects. It gives you the chance to meet other students, to make new friends, to develop your hidden abilities that will be useful to you later in life. BEST gives you the chance [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":0,"parent"